    <string name="how_to_update_title">How to update without losing data</string>
    <string name="how_to_update_body">When a new release is available, the owner sends the updated APK on WhatsApp or via GitHub Release. Install the new APK directly over your existing app without uninstalling. All your settings, custom policies, and active license activation will be retained automatically because both APKs are signed with the same keystore.</string>

